    {
      "schema_version": 6,
      "book_id": "2TI",
      "chapter": 3,
      "chapter_usfm": "2TI.3",
      "version_id": 90,
      "version_abbr": "LEB",
      "verses": [
        {
          "verse": 1,
          "usfm": "2TI.3.1",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "But know this, that in the last days difficult times will come,"
        },
        {
          "verse": 2,
          "usfm": "2TI.3.2",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "for people will be lovers of themselves, lovers of money, boasters, arrogant, slanderers, disobedient to parents, ungrateful, unholy,"
        },
        {
          "verse": 3,
          "usfm": "2TI.3.3",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "hardhearted, irreconcilable, slanderous, without self-control, savage, with no interest for what is good,"
        },
        {
          "verse": 4,
          "usfm": "2TI.3.4",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "traitors, reckless, conceited, loving pleasure rather than loving God,"
        },
        {
          "verse": 5,
          "usfm": "2TI.3.5",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "maintaining a form of godliness, but denying its power. Avoid these people."
        },
        {
          "verse": 6,
          "usfm": "2TI.3.6",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "For from these are those who slip into houses and captivate foolish women loaded down with sins, led by various kinds of desires,"
        },
        {
          "verse": 7,
          "usfm": "2TI.3.7",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "always learning and never able to come to a knowledge of the truth."
        },
        {
          "verse": 8,
          "usfm": "2TI.3.8",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "And just as Jannes and Jambres opposed Moses, so also these oppose the truth, people corrupted in mind, disqualified concerning the faith."
        },
        {
          "verse": 9,
          "usfm": "2TI.3.9",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "But they will not progress to a greater extent, for their folly will be quite evident to everyone, as also the folly of those two was."
        },
        {
          "verse": 10,
          "usfm": "2TI.3.10",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "But you have faithfully followed my teaching, way of life, purpose, faith, patience, love, endurance,"
        },
        {
          "verse": 11,
          "usfm": "2TI.3.11",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "persecutions, and sufferings that happened to me in Antioch, in Iconium, and in Lystra, what sort of persecutions I endured, and the Lord delivered me from all of them."
        },
        {
          "verse": 12,
          "usfm": "2TI.3.12",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "And indeed, all those who want to live in a godly manner in Christ Jesus will be persecuted."
        },
        {
          "verse": 13,
          "usfm": "2TI.3.13",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "But evil people and imposters will progress to the worse, deceiving and being deceived."
        },
        {
          "verse": 14,
          "usfm": "2TI.3.14",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "But you continue in the things which you have learned and are convinced of, because you know from whom you learned them,"
        },
        {
          "verse": 15,
          "usfm": "2TI.3.15",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "and that from childhood you have known the holy writings that are able to make you wise for salvation through faith in Christ Jesus."
        },
        {
          "verse": 16,
          "usfm": "2TI.3.16",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "All scripture is inspired by God and profitable for teaching, for reproof, for correction, for training in righteousness,"
        },
        {
          "verse": 17,
          "usfm": "2TI.3.17",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "in order that the person of God may be competent, equipped for every good work."
        }
      ],
      "verse_count": 17,
      "headings": [
        {
          "before_verse": 10,
          "text": "The Value of the Scriptures"
        }
      ],
      "footnotes": [
